WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.875
ArriveCAN.

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:08.425
A COVID border questionnaire estimated at 80,000 dollars ultimately cost 93 million.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:11.812
A two-person contractor was awarded the work.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:16.712
76 percent of subcontractors performed no measurable work.

00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:21.550
The Auditor General found systematic failures in procurement oversight.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:29.412
Parliament voted 172 to 165 to recover the money — every Liberal MP voted against.
